- "She is good in communication ,but when she has to convey messages about being hungry ,or her diaper is full she would scratch us .We set boundaries when we say no to scratching and say what she need by holding her hands and asking what she wants ." [sr033-0109]

**But:** Timeout can stop the immediate episode without preventing a later one: "It does stop the behavior in that moment but idk if he learns anything from it, because he just hits me again later that day." [sr080-0099]

