- "However, he hasn't gained any weight over the last 3–4 months, and he's having more episodes where he gets frustrated over minor things and cries a lot." [sr095-0114]

**But:** The parent describing spitting explicitly calls it play rather than malice. "I know she’s just playing and not doing it maliciously but it’s so gross!" [sr077-0110]

