- "I don’t know what triggers this tantrum versus a normal “I’ve been told no” or “I don’t understand how to work this” tantrum." [sr131-0055]
- "He did it earlier today and busted his little lip and it was bleeding. I am just dumbfounded and don’t know how to correct it. I don’t want to ignore him and just leave him if he’s actually hurt…but he’s hurting himself and I don’t want to encourage it either by teaching him that busting his mouth is what will get me to pick him up." [sr080-0050]
