A keyword-free random sample of 20,000 Reddit posts from twelve parenting subreddits, 1 April–24 October 2026, yielded 2,471 on-niche posts; this pattern contains 420 on-niche and 143 near posts. Each count records posts tagged by one reader; forms were merged across digest readers by judgement, and counts describe posts, not people or market prevalence. Both digests were read whole; two supplied records repeat wording, unknown ages remain unknown, and an inconsistent near-post age is unresolved; cross-tags overlap and absence means unstated.
